  scientificName: Helleborus niger
  treatmentText: A dark, toxic flower with roots that grow deep into the ground, it causes severe vomiting to quickly expel any swallowed toxins or blockages in the stomach.
  warningText: The violent spasming causes severe burns to the throat, which can be fatal for patients who already have acid-related illnesses or throat ulcers.
